      <isolationStep id="stp-0002"><action><para>Do the belt condition check (<dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="M40" systemDiffCode="A" systemCode="32" subSystemCode="0" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="A" infoCode="345" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef>).</para></action><isolationStepQuestion>What is the condition of the cooling fan belt: tight, loose or broken?</isolationStepQuestion>
